IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sga-part1`

-- sga-tests-part1.l4: worked cases for sga-part1.l4. Expected values are hand-written from the text of sections 3 to 5C.

§ `Section 3`

-- 3(1): binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, each State, the ACT and the NT.
#ASSERT `this Act binds the Crown in right of` `the Commonwealth` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `this Act binds the Crown in right of` `a State` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `this Act binds the Crown in right of` `the Australian Capital Territory` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `this Act binds the Crown in right of` `the Northern Territory` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A government section 3 does not name: the text does not say.
#ASSERT `this Act binds the Crown in right of` `a government not named in section 3` EQUALS NOTHING
-- 3(2): nothing in this Act permits the Crown to be prosecuted.
#ASSERT `this Act permits the Crown to be prosecuted for an offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 5(1) and (4): the Commonwealth, Departments and untaxable authorities`

#ASSERT `section 5(1) makes the body liable to pay superannuation guarantee charge` `the Commonwealth` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `section 5(1) makes the body liable to pay superannuation guarantee charge` `a Commonwealth Department` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `section 5(1) makes the body liable to pay superannuation guarantee charge` `an untaxable Commonwealth authority` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Any other person: section 5(1) says nothing.
#ASSERT `section 5(1) makes the body liable to pay superannuation guarantee charge` `any other person` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `subsection 14ZX(4), section 14ZZ and Divisions 4 and 5 of Part IVC of the Taxation Administration Act 1953 apply to the body` `the Commonwealth` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `subsection 14ZX(4), section 14ZZ and Divisions 4 and 5 of Part IVC of the Taxation Administration Act 1953 apply to the body` `an untaxable Commonwealth authority` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `subsection 14ZX(4), section 14ZZ and Divisions 4 and 5 of Part IVC of the Taxation Administration Act 1953 apply to the body` `any other person` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 5(5) definitions`

-- Commonwealth Department: any one of (a), (b), (c).
#ASSERT `is a Commonwealth Department` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `is a Commonwealth Department` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `is a Commonwealth Department` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`is a Commonwealth Department` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- Commonwealth entity: a PGPA Commonwealth entity that cannot be made liable to taxation.
#ASSERT `is a Commonwealth entity for section 5` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`is a Commonwealth entity for section 5` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`is a Commonwealth entity for section 5` FALSE FALSE)
-- untaxable Commonwealth authority.
#ASSERT `is an untaxable Commonwealth authority` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`is an untaxable Commonwealth authority` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`is an untaxable Commonwealth authority` FALSE FALSE)
-- responsible Department: (a) annual Appropriation Act, (b)(i), (b)(ii), (c) the Constitution.
#ASSERT `the responsible Department` `an annual Appropriation Act` EQUALS `the Commonwealth Department in respect of which the money was appropriated`
#ASSERT `the responsible Department` `an Act other than an annual Appropriation Act, and the employee performs or performed the duties in or in respect of a Commonwealth Department` EQUALS `the Commonwealth Department in or in respect of which the duties are performed`
#ASSERT `the responsible Department` `an Act other than an annual Appropriation Act, in any other case` EQUALS `the Department of State administered by the Minister who administers the Act under which the money was appropriated`
#ASSERT `the responsible Department` `the Constitution` EQUALS `the Finance Department`

§ `Section 5(2) to (3)`

-- 5(3): treated as paid on the day it would have become payable had the entity been a company: 28 July 2026 stays 28 July 2026.
#ASSERT `the day the charge of a responsible Department or untaxable Commonwealth authority is treated as paid` (Date 28 7 2026) EQUALS Date 28 7 2026
-- 5(2B), (2C): in writing and necessary or convenient.
#ASSERT `a direction of the Finance Minister has effect and must be complied with` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a direction of the Finance Minister has effect and must be complied with` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a direction of the Finance Minister has effect and must be complied with` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 5(2): a Commonwealth employee; otherwise the text does not say.
#ASSERT `the Act treats the responsible Department as the employer and as a company and a government body` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the Act treats the responsible Department as the employer and as a company and a government body` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 5A`

#ASSERT `is a Commonwealth authority` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`is a Commonwealth authority` FALSE)
-- Passed before commencement and would apply: taken not to exempt.
#ASSERT `a law exempts a Commonwealth authority from superannuation guarantee charge` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a law exempts a Commonwealth authority from superannuation guarantee charge` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Passed after commencement: not taken to exempt unless it expressly exempts from the charge.
#ASSERT `a law exempts a Commonwealth authority from superannuation guarantee charge` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `a law exempts a Commonwealth authority from superannuation guarantee charge` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The exemption would not apply to the charge apart from this section: section 5A is not engaged.
#ASSERT `a law exempts a Commonwealth authority from superannuation guarantee charge` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 5B`

#ASSERT `this Act or the Superannuation Guarantee Charge Act 1992 affects the Fair Work Commission or the Fair Work legislation` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Part 3A is outside the "nothing in this Act" rule; an express reference in the Fair Work legislation is outside subsection (1).
#ASSERT `this Act or the Superannuation Guarantee Charge Act 1992 affects the Fair Work Commission or the Fair Work legislation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `this Act or the Superannuation Guarantee Charge Act 1992 affects the Fair Work Commission or the Fair Work legislation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 5C`

#ASSERT `Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code applies to the offence` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not an offence against this Act: the text does not say.
#ASSERT `Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code applies to the offence` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
